@Host = http://localhost:5138

### 1. Create Valid Order (Logs Information with Structured Properties)
POST {{Host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust_9988",
  "amount": 250.75,
  "itemName": "Ergonomic Office Chair"
}

### 2. Create Invalid Order (Logs Warning)
POST {{Host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "",
  "amount": -50.00,
  "itemName": "Bad Item"
}

### 3. Get Order by ID (Logs Diagnostic Search)
GET {{Host}}/api/orders/ORD-SAMPLE1

### 4. Fail Order (Logs Error with Exception and Stack Trace)
POST {{Host}}/api/orders/ORD-SAMPLE1/fail
